items.translit:
Allahumma rabbana laka al-hamdu mil’a as-samawati;

Wa mil’a al-ardi;

Wa mil’a ma shi’ta min shay’in ba‘d;

Ahlath-thana’i wal-majd;

Ahaqqu ma qala al-‘abdu wa kulluna laka ‘abd;

Allahumma la mani‘a lima a‘tayt;

Wala mu‘tiya lima mana‘t;

Wala yanfa‘u dhal-jaddi minka al-jaddu.

Allahumma laka al-hamdu, anta qayyimus-samawati wal-ardi wa man fihinna;

Wa laka al-hamdu, laka mulkus-samawati wal-ardi wa man fihinna;

Wa laka al-hamdu, anta nurus-samawati wal-ardi wa man fihinna;

Wa laka al-hamdu, anta malikus-samawati wal-ard;

Wa laka al-hamdu, anta al-haqqu, wa wa‘duka al-haqqu, wa liqa’uka haqq, wa qawluka haqq,

Wal-jannatu haqq, wan-naru haqq, wan-nabiyyuna haqq, wa Muhammadun ﷺ haqq, was-sa‘atu haqq;

Allahumma laka aslamtu, wa bika amantu, wa ‘alayka tawakkaltu, wa ilayka anabtu,

Wa bika khasamtu, wa ilayka hakamtu;

Faghfir li ma qaddamtu wa ma akhkhartu, wa ma asrartu wa ma a‘lantu;

Antal-muqaddimu wa antal-mu’akhkhir, la ilaha illa anta.

Allahumma laka al-hamdu kulluh;

Allahumma la qabida lima basatta;

Wala basita lima qabadt;

Wala hadiya liman adlalta;

Wala mudilla liman hadayt;

Wala mu‘tiya lima mana‘t;

Wala mani‘a lima a‘tayt;

Wala muqarriba lima ba‘adt;

Wala muba‘ida lima qarrabt.

Allahumma rabbas-samawatis-sab‘i wa rabbal-ardi;

Wa rabbal-‘arshil-‘azim;

Rabbana wa rabba kulli shay’;

Faliqal-habbi wan-nawa;

Wa munzilat-tawrati wal-injili wal-furqan;

A‘udhu bika min sharri kulli shay’in anta akhidun binasiyatih;

Allahumma antal-awwalu fa laysa qablaka shay’;

Wa antal-akhiru fa laysa ba‘daka shay’;

Wa antaz-zahiru fa laysa fawqaka shay’;

Wa antal-batinu fa laysa dunaka shay’;

Iqdi ‘anna ad-dayna wa aghnina minal-faqr.

Allahumma a‘udhu biridaka min sakhatik;

Wa bimu‘afatik min ‘uqubatik;

Wa a‘udhu bika minka;

La uhsi thana’an ‘alayk;

Anta kama athnayta ‘ala nafsik.

Alhamdu lillahi rabbil-‘alamin;

Ar-rahmanir-rahim;

Maliki yawmid-din;

La ilaha illallahu yaf‘alu ma yurid;

Allahumma anta Allah, la ilaha illa anta;

Antal-ghaniyyu wa nahnu al-fuqara’.

Alhamdu lillahil-ladhi kafani wa awani;

Alhamdu lillahil-ladhi at‘amani wa saqani;

Alhamdu lillahil-ladhi manna ‘alayya fa afdala;

Allahumma inni as’aluka bi‘izzatika an tunajjiyani minan-nar.

Alhamdu lillahil-ladhi yut‘imu wa la yut‘am;

Manna ‘alayna fahadana, wa at‘amana wa saqana;

Wa kulla bala’in hasanin ablana;

Alhamdu lillahi ghayra muwadda‘in wa la mukafa’in wa la makfuren wa la mustaghna ‘anhu;

Alhamdu lillahil-ladhi at‘ama minal-ta‘am;

Wa saqa minash-sharab;

Wa kasa minal-‘ury;

Wa hada minad-dalalah;

Wa bassara minal-‘ama;

Wa faddala ‘ala kathirin min khalqihi tafdila;

Alhamdu lillahi rabbil-‘alamin.

Allahumma inni ush-hiduka;

Wa ush-hidu hamalata ‘arshika;

Wa mala’ikataka;

Wa jami‘a khalqik;

Annaka anta Allah, la ilaha illa anta, wahdaka la sharika lak;

Wa anna Muhammadan ‘abduka wa rasuluk.

Subhanallahi wa bihamdih;

‘Adada khalqih;

Wa rida nafsih;

Wa zinata ‘arshih;

Wa midada kalimatih.

Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdik;

Wa tabarakasmuk;

Wa ta‘ala jadduk;

Wa la ilaha ghayruk.

Allahu akbaru kabira;

Walhamdu lillahi kathira;

Wasubhanallahi bukratan wa asila.

La ilaha illallahu al-‘azimu al-halim;

La ilaha illallahu rabbul-‘arshil-‘azim;

La ilaha illallahu rabbus-samawati wa rabbul-ardi wa rabbul-‘arshil-karim.

La ilaha illallahu, wahdahu la sharika lah;

Lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu;

Wahuwa ‘ala kulli shay’in qadeer.

La ilaha illallahu al-wahidu al-qahhar;

Rabbu as-samawati wal-ardi wa ma baynahuma;

Al-‘azizu al-ghaffar.

Subhanallah;

Walhamdulillah;

La ilaha illallah;

Wallahu akbar.
